// With the tour configuration: 39 logical qubits, 6 physical qubits.
// Each temporary is cleaned, including restoring number's earlier version.
// --no-wire-reuse retains all 39 wires and exceeds the 24-qubit run limit.
quint number = 1;
for (int i = 0; i < 12; i++) {
    quint temporary = number + 1;
    number += 1;
}
return measure(number); // -3 after signed three-bit wraparound.
